id: memory_manager_dtcm
label: Memory Manager DTCM Support
package: platform_core
description: >
  This component adds DTCM initialization, enables the proper retention control of
  DTCM banks and memory allocations on the DTCM through the memory manager.
  It provides the necessary configuration and setup to utilize the ARM Cortex-M55 DTCM as
  an additional memory heap for dynamic allocations, enhancing the available memory
  pool for applications requiring larger memory footprints or faster memory.
category: Services|Memory Manager
quality: evaluation
ui_hints:
  visibility: never
metadata:
  sbom:
    license: Zlib
root_path: platform_core/platform/service/memory_manager
provides:
- name: memory_manager_dtcm
requires:
- name: memory_manager
- name: device_has_dtcm
template_contribution:
- name: component_catalog
  value: memory_manager_dtcm
